  "$comment": "Swarm 1.2.8 row 54b (AC-VIS3b, AT-V3-task/-subprocess/-gateway_*/-data_object/-annotation, register N8-373, N8-475). Synthetic labels only. `gallery`: swimlane, 2 lanes: exclusive and parallel gateways, task, sub-process. `shapes`: flow LR, task, sub-process, data object and annotation on sync associations. `gateways`: graph, the four gateways and a task. `split` / `merge`: flow LR, an exclusive gateway with two exits on its right side, a parallel gateway with two entries on its left side (C86 spread). `split_tb`: flow TB, gateway exits to the nodes beside it leave by its side vertices. `process`: graph LR at 166 mm only (five columns), start -> task -> exclusive gateway -> two tasks -> end, data object and annotation (eye check figure). `gateways_tagged`: tags and subs (N8-371 gateway case), a hatched gateway. `gateway_no_exit`: P3-diamond-exits. `iso_chart`: ISO 5807 shapes for the chart flowchart REPORT. Built at 128 and 166 mm unless the test says otherwise. Not part of the 52b CHAR corpus (new shape tokens).",
